    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/205f04287235dff42fa9ef666b0a0519.poster.avif?t=1666378010\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/205f04287235dff42fa9ef666b0a0519.webm?t=1666378010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/205f04287235dff42fa9ef666b0a0519.mp4?t=1666378010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Play it your way, each hero has 3 different card categories, attack, defense, and utility. You can put together the combinations that best suit your play style.<br><br>Each category also has its own relics, which can further enhance your gameplay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Advanced Rune System</h2>Enhance your deck with an advanced rune system that adds unique talents to your cards. This allows the deck construction to have endless possibilities.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Corruption</h2>The world is in a constant fight against corruption, which grows stronger as the days go by and applies disease to your world. These diseases directly interfere with combat and game difficulty, since the number of diseases increases with each full moon (7 days).<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Day &amp; Night Cycle</h2>Create strategies and prepare for the night in the midst of battle. At dusk, monsters of the night appear and black portals are opened. Get exclusive rewards if you win a night battle! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/aa70ee2120755ff5490367b2fca3421b.poster.avif?t=1666378010\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/aa70ee2120755ff5490367b2fca3421b.webm?t=1666378010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/aa70ee2120755ff5490367b2fca3421b.mp4?t=1666378010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Weather Events</h2>Rains, sandstorms, blizzards. Some events can benefit you, but others can end your battle, be aware and use them to your advantage.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/7e23a37074fa68739f461724a7a78460.poster.avif?t=1666378010\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/7e23a37074fa68739f461724a7a78460.webm?t=1666378010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/7e23a37074fa68739f461724a7a78460.mp4?t=1666378010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>150+ Cards<br></li><li>70+ Relics<br></li><li>30+ Runes<br></li><li>50+ Battle Encounters<br></li><li>30+ Mysterious Encounters<br></li><li>7 Maps</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/205f04287235dff42fa9ef666b0a0519.poster.avif?t=1666378010\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/205f04287235dff42fa9ef666b0a0519.webm?t=1666378010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/205f04287235dff42fa9ef666b0a0519.mp4?t=1666378010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Play it your way, each hero has 3 different card categories, attack, defense, and utility. You can put together the combinations that best suit your play style.<br><br>Each category also has its own relics, which can further enhance your gameplay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Advanced Rune System</h2>Enhance your deck with an advanced rune system that adds unique talents to your cards. This allows the deck construction to have endless possibilities.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Corruption</h2>The world is in a constant fight against corruption, which grows stronger as the days go by and applies disease to your world. These diseases directly interfere with combat and game difficulty, since the number of diseases increases with each full moon (7 days).<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Day &amp; Night Cycle</h2>Create strategies and prepare for the night in the midst of battle. At dusk, monsters of the night appear and black portals are opened. Get exclusive rewards if you win a night battle! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/aa70ee2120755ff5490367b2fca3421b.poster.avif?t=1666378010\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/aa70ee2120755ff5490367b2fca3421b.webm?t=1666378010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/aa70ee2120755ff5490367b2fca3421b.mp4?t=1666378010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Weather Events</h2>Rains, sandstorms, blizzards. Some events can benefit you, but others can end your battle, be aware and use them to your advantage.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/7e23a37074fa68739f461724a7a78460.poster.avif?t=1666378010\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/7e23a37074fa68739f461724a7a78460.webm?t=1666378010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687740/extras/7e23a37074fa68739f461724a7a78460.mp4?t=1666378010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>150+ Cards<br></li><li>70+ Relics<br></li><li>30+ Runes<br></li><li>50+ Battle Encounters<br></li><li>30+ Mysterious Encounters<br></li><li>7 Maps</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Noyah: Corrupted Memories is a roguelike deckbuilder, in pixel art, with random battle generation, day and night cycle, climate events, advanced rune system, that allows you to create endless possibilities with a single card.",
